# Puerta de la Reserva (C5b, contract 48), 11 x 8, interior. column = i, row = j. The Reserva Salvaje's gate house in Ciudad Ambar: the ATTENDANT (5,2) behind the counter takes the $500 fee and
# gives the 30 Reserva Crystals and the 500 steps (`reserva_start`, contract 43.3: the way home = the tile in front of the counter (5,4), where the script runs); a bag that cannot hold the crystals, no money and a session already
# on have their own texts. The door into the Reserva (10,4..5) is a pair of STEP TRIGGERS, not a warp: without a session the guard turns him back (`reserva_left`); with one the script warps him to reserva_1. A board on the wall
# shows the rules (and the steps / crystals left while a session runs: `reserva_left` + `gl.c5b.rv_left`). Wooden floor; the mats (5..6,7) lead back to Ambar.
@map puerta_reserva
@size 11 8
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 5 6 N
@spawn from_reserva 9 4 W
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  a  tile=none object=wall_corner
  b  tile=none object=wall_j
  c  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  d  tile=none object=wall_i
  e  object=shelf
  S  object=sign script=board interact=look
  A  npc=guardia id=att face=SW script=attendant
  C  object=counter
  t  object=stool
  l  object=candle_s
  M  tile=mat interact=step script=enter_reserva
  N  tile=mat
@grid
  abcbbbcbbbb
  d.ee....S..
  d....A.....
  d...CCC....
  d.........M
  dt......l.M
  dt.........
  d....NN....
@warp N -> ciudad_ambar spawn=reserva_door
# The attendant (the counter script of 43.3): the fee, the crystals, the steps. Var 4 = the session op's answer.
@script attendant npc
    npc_face_hero att
    reserva_left 4
    jv 4 1 inside
    say puerta.hi
    ask puerta.ask
    jv 0 1 pay
    say puerta.no
    end
  pay:
    reserva_start 4
    jv 4 1 ok
    jv 4 2 nomoney
    jv 4 3 full
    say puerta.in
    end
  ok:
    sfx item
    say puerta.ok
    end
  nomoney:
    say gl.shop.no_money
    end
  full:
    say puerta.full
    end
  inside:
    say puerta.in
@end
# The door into the Reserva: only with a session on (the fee paid); the hero is turned back otherwise.
@script enter_reserva step
    reserva_left 4
    jv 4 1 go
    say puerta.nopay
    hero_walk NW 1
    end
  go:
    warp reserva_1 spawn=gate
@end
# The rules board: the rules, or (with a session on) the steps and crystals left.
@script board interact
    reserva_left 4
    jv 4 1 inside
    say puerta.board
    end
  inside:
    say gl.c5b.rv_left
@end
